OL,5,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's Dave 'Butterfly' Botha's turn
OL,7,     Fto host at his two-star
OL,8,     Festablishment, Butterfly
OL,9,     FParagliding B&B on the Isle of
OL,10,     FWight, where he opts for a
OL,11,     Fbarbecue dinner despite the
OL,12,     Ffreezing weather.
OL,13,G1650 Four in a Bed
